                <h1>Researching the stack from <span>model</span> to metal.</h1>
                <div class="concept-bottom">
                  <div class="terminal-card"><span>01 / CURRENT</span><p>Microsoft Translator</p></div>
                  <div class="terminal-card"><span>02 / LATEST</span><p>DGX Spark memory reclaim</p></div>
                  <div class="terminal-card"><span>03 / OPEN SOURCE</span><p>Marian NMT</p></div>
